{"type":"message","id":"098274a6","parentId":"03b5a9b3","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:31:49.845Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning 500 with error code 1101 for the send endpoint. The GET /history works fine but POST /send is failing. This could be an issue with the Cloudflare Worker endpoint, or perhaps the API has some specific requirements. Let me try with the content as query parameter but in a different format.\n\nActually the error code 1101 typically means \"Worker exceeded memory limit\" in Cloudflare Workers. This could be a server-side issue.\n\nLet me try a simpler message to see if it's a payload size issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-6e4f4a97-ad49-4302-b3ec-ce4e22f5e3a3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" \\\n  -d 'test' 2>&1"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: text/plain\\\" \\\\\\n  -d 'test' 2>&1\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":608,"output":196,"cacheRead":18640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19444,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779341503373,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ea01daf6-0a10-449f-b612-af9467efb6b5"}}
